  "solution": "Given:\n\n120 ÷ [13 + {47 - (36 - 36 ÷ 9 of 2 × 3)}]\n\nConcept used:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/c6dff4d58ce66b38e0cdda1b0a721fa32c2ef301f704e653b2f493673a6e332b.png] \n\nCalculation:\n\n120 ÷ [13 + {47 - (36 - 36 ÷ 9 of 2 × 3)}]\n\n⇒ 120 ÷ [13 + {47 - (36 - 36 ÷ 18 × 3)}]\n\n⇒ 120 ÷ [13 + {47 - (36 - 2 × 3)}]\n\n⇒ 120 ÷ [13 + {47 - (36 - 6)}]\n\n⇒ 120 ÷ [13 + {47 - 30}]\n\n⇒ 120 ÷ [13 + 17]\n\n⇒ 120 ÷ 30\n\n⇒ 4\n\n**∴ The required value of 120 ÷ [13 + {47 - (36 - 36 ÷ 9 of 2 × 3)}] is 4.**",
